\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Interestingly I think that was done in revised edition, then w20 brought it back.</div> </div> </div> </div>Odd decision. I mean it makes sense in a toolbox sense but I also think one of the nasty camps being gone is an interesting plotpoint. i presume they don't get any mechanics unlike say.....dying Cubs?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-19T04:57:05-07:00","id":1464504,"title":"","content":"I like all the tribes having radical camps of &quot;evil&quot;. There's certainly room for it; Hiemdal, I think the silver fang had raptors who hunt down those who challenge SF supremacy, the Shadow lords have their own cults, Perhaps there are still BF that are sacrificing males out there, and who knows what kind of degenerates and radicals can be found among Rat's children. Some Tribes could easily have multiple antagonistic factions. The Glass walkers are uniquely positioned to have around eight. I think radical, antagonistic Star-Gazers would be more popular than the main tribe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25794,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","user":"MyWifeIsScary","date":". 10-19-2021, 09:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-19T08:58:16-07:00","id":1464517,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464497#post1464497\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Odd decision. I mean it makes sense in a toolbox sense but I also think one of the nasty camps being gone is an interesting plotpoint. i presume they don't get any mechanics unlike say.....dying Cubs?</div> </div> </div> </div>Zero mechanics near as I can tell. Just oh look bigoted werewolves. But everyone also likes to pretend their tribe book doesnt exist. <br /> <br /> At this point I\u2019m assuming the tribes we\u2019ll get in 5th will look markedly different then how they\u2019ve appeared previously.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-19T09:51:25-07:00","id":1464518,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464497#post1464497\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Odd decision. I mean it makes sense in a toolbox sense but I also think one of the nasty camps being gone is an interesting plotpoint. i presume they don't get any mechanics unlike say.....dying Cubs?</div> </div> </div> </div>It may be because W20 was metaplot agnostic for a long time.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-19T10:22:11-07:00","id":1464521,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464518#post1464518\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It may be because W20 was metaplot agnostic for a long time.</div> </div> </div> </div> Yeah that makes sense. Kind of like how you can do tremere antritibu in v20","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 10-19-2021, 03:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-19T12:53:11-07:00","id":1464529,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464504#post1464504\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like all the tribes having radical camps of &quot;evil&quot;. There's certainly room for it; Hiemdal, I think the silver fang had raptors who hunt down those who challenge SF supremacy, the Shadow lords have their own cults, Perhaps there are still BF that are sacrificing males out there, and who knows what kind of degenerates and radicals can be found among Rat's children. Some Tribes could easily have multiple antagonistic factions. The Glass walkers are uniquely positioned to have around eight. I think radical, antagonistic Star-Gazers would be more popular than the main tribe.</div> </div> </div> </div>Like I said, I wouldn't have a problem with the massacre of the Sword of Heimdall but I would have established it as a way to broaden the Get of Fenris in public perception. &quot;These Aryan wannabes forgot the Get of Fenris included a shit ton of Get had <i>history</i> with the Nazis. Specifically of hunting down and murdering every single one of their tribe who were involved with the Third Reich and they don't like their cosplayers.&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-19T13:18:30-07:00","id":1464531,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464529#post1464529\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Like I said, I wouldn't have a problem with the massacre of the Sword of Heimdall but I would have established it as a way to broaden the Get of Fenris in public perception. &quot;These Aryan wannabes forgot the Get of Fenris included a shit ton of Get had <i>history</i> with the Nazis. Specifically of hunting down and murdering every single one of their tribe who were involved with the Third Reich and they don't like their cosplayers.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Which of course is non-sense. Because, there were a lot of get of fenris and get of fenris kin in Germany and with ever since the Nazi party got elected (democratically I might add), pretty much every person in Germany was directly ruled by the Nazis. Every mayor, alderman, council member on the communal level was successively replaced by Nazis and people had to fall in line or face consequences. When my grandfather died we found a letter, stating that my great-grandfather wasn't allowed to increase his tabacco production rate (my family owned a farm), because he still hat commercial dealings with jews.<br /> And once the war was in full gear, the get of fenris and their kin had to defend their homeland from the allies, regardless of how they stood towards the Nazi regime.<br /> <br /> So, just like the Allied didn't kill just any German or even any person who was member in the Nazi party, the Get of Fenris wouldn't and shouldn't just indiscriminately kill the Get who were asoziated with the Nazis - indiscriminately killing is wyrmish, isn't it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-19T13:55:06-07:00","id":1464534,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>heinrich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464531#post1464531\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Which of course is non-sense. Because, there were a lot of get of fenris and get of fenris kin in Germany and with ever since the Nazi party got elected (democratically I might add), pretty much every person in Germany was directly ruled by the Nazis. Every mayor, alderman, council member on the communal level was successively replaced by Nazis and people had to fall in line or face consequences. When my grandfather died we found a letter, stating that my great-grandfather wasn't allowed to increase his tabacco production rate (my family owned a farm), because he still hat commercial dealings with jews.<br /> And once the war was in full gear, the get of fenris and their kin had to defend their homeland from the allies, regardless of how they stood towards the Nazi regime.<br /> <br /> So, just like the Allied didn't kill just any German or even any person who was member in the Nazi party, the Get of Fenris wouldn't and shouldn't just indiscriminately kill the Get who were asoziated with the Nazis - indiscriminately killing is wyrmish, isn't it?</div> </div> </div> </div>Heinrich, I feel like you utterly missed the point of my post. Which is the majority of Get of Fenris aren't German and have been established as being the largest tribe....in Russia. I feel the internationalism of the Get of Fenris has been seriously downplayed. One of the things Heart of the Forest pointed out again was all the Get of Fenris who were Polish.<br /> <br /> How do you think THEY felt about the Nazis?<br /> <br /> THAT is a good solution for the Get=Nazi thing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-19T14:10:28-07:00","id":1464535,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464534#post1464534\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Heinrich, I feel like you utterly missed the point of my post. Which is the majority of Get of Fenris aren't German and have been established as being the largest tribe....in Russia. I feel the internationalism of the Get of Fenris has been seriously downplayed. One of the things Heart of the Forest pointed out again was all the Get of Fenris who were Polish.<br /> <br /> How do you think THEY felt about the Nazis?<br /> <br /> THAT is a good solution for the Get=Nazi thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>they are not called get of fenris in the game","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24832-blailton","name":"blailton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24832_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-19T14:17:08-07:00","id":1464536,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blailton</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464535#post1464535\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">they are not called get of fenris in the game</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you for that correction.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-19T16:11:34-07:00","id":1464539,"title":"","content":"Also, there's a comic in the books that established American Fenrir snuck into the US Army to fight the Nazis. In case we wanted something more overtly stated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-19T19:25:48-07:00","id":1464550,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>heinrich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464531#post1464531\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Which of course is non-sense. Because, there were a lot of get of fenris and get of fenris kin in Germany and with ever since the Nazi party got elected (democratically I might add)</div> </div> </div> </div>Fascists have a history of preying on middle of the road liberal democracies and eating them from the inside out, yes.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> , pretty much every person in Germany was directly ruled by the Nazis. Every mayor, alderman, council member on the communal level was successively replaced by Nazis and people had to fall in line or face consequences. When my grandfather died we found a letter, stating that my great-grandfather wasn't allowed to increase his tabacco production rate (my family owned a farm), because he still hat commercial dealings with jews.<br /> And once the war was in full gear, the get of fenris and their kin had to defend their homeland from the allies, regardless of how they stood towards the Nazi regime. </div> </div> </div>But why would the Get, who usually have too much Rage to participate in human politics, be involved overly much with that or any other human government? Their kin might have taken positions, but those kin would probably be operating in a capacity similar to monkeywrenchers, because Nazis wanted industrialization, economic control, and urban growth, none of which Garou in general and GoF in particular have historically liked very much.<br /> <br /> Given the propensity of the tribe to fight against anything even vaguely Aesir, too, they might have decided to get involved against the Nazis as a majority after they traced a bunch of enemy spirits and fomori back to the Nazis, and had their kin hide the folk who the Nazis were hunting on general principle.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> So, just like the Allied didn't kill just any German or even any person who was member in the Nazi party, the Get of Fenris wouldn't and shouldn't just indiscriminately kill the Get who were asoziated with the Nazis - indiscriminately killing is wyrmish, isn't it? </div> </div> </div>This has big time &quot;So much for the tolerant left!&quot; energy.<br /> <br /> This isn't indiscriminate killing. It is, in fact, very discriminate killing - you aren't going around left and right just slaughtering anyone. Swords of Heimdall and other Nazi Garou are very rare, deliberately made a decision to carry on their ideology, and are a blight upon the Gaia they claim to serve by... doing the same things that the Nazis did.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-19T20:05:39-07:00","id":1464559,"title":"","content":"Honestly, these sorts of discussions also well... seem to play very loose with the word &quot;fascist,&quot; and edge up on meaning more, &quot;asshole with autocratic leanings,&quot; rather than the specifics that make of fascist ideology (also Nazism is a form of fascism, but not all fascism is Nazism).<br /> <br /> There's no reason the Get would like fascism, at all. What they like is a social construct that's easily corrupted by fascists... which would make them being intolerant towards fascists even more.<br /> <br /> For the Get of Fenris might makes right. This means that Get bow to the power of others. The Fenrir might not like it, but if a Bone Gnawer takes on a Fenrir in an honorable duel and wins? The Gnawer was stronger, and is right, and they'll do what the Gnawer says.<br /> <br /> For a fascist, might makes right is a practice of circular logic. Fascists define themselves as the strong, thus they're always right, and because they're always in the right, there is no valid way to demonstrate more power than them; losing is only a sign of dishonorable actions by their enemies not a failing in the strength of the fascists. That's what outsider/othered scapegoats are important to fascists. They need to convince their populace that anything imperfect about their great and powerful nation is the fault of underhanded sabotage by those evil baddies.<br /> <br /> For me, the problem with the Swords as a camp, is that it's a really bad way to tackle fascist radicalization in the Fenrir to just have a bunch of Nazi werewolves. The Black Eagle Fellowship is a much better vehicle... as the way fascistic radicialization tends to worm into private paramilitary groups would seem much more timely and believable than openly Nazi werewolves in 2020.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-19T22:52:49-07:00","id":1464564,"title":"","content":"I find the idea that the Fenrir would join the Nazis by any considerable number to be laughable. Werewolves are not that connected to mortal society. they're not the people suffering from hyperinflation and they can easily look out for their kinfolk, they're not going to be angry that the country surrendered and took a treaty because <i>that war probably gave them way too many banes to fight</i>. And they're not going to look at jews as scapegoats because they can clearly see where the bigger banes are flocking at. Garou are going to be more connected to other tribe members in caerns they've never been to than the mortal populaces within their spheres of influence. Any assertions of a master race is going to look mighty stupid to shapeshifting demi-spirit werewolves and their pure bred kinfolk.<br /> <br /> Let's not even get into the esoteric reasons that might piss Get off, like Himmler's deliberate rape of archaeological truth. The only thing that would really appeal from fascist ideology that lupines would use is the idea that kinfolk should have more babies. But they were doing that anyway.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25794,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","user":"MyWifeIsScary","date":". 10-20-2021, 01:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-19T23:47:20-07:00","id":1464566,"title":"","content":"Comics about American Fenrir killing German Nazi garou was as I remember in first tribebook and was very cool.<br /> I don't understand all the mess with Fenrir. Facts:<br /> 1. Fenrir fought in both sides at WWII. Some of trhem were Nazi some of them were not.<br /> 2. Fenrir hunted the rest of Nazi garou (possibly killing them all).<br /> 3. In revised at grand moot children of Fenrir gathered no matter sex, skin colour, cause they all are part of the tribe. They have to come to terms with the past. End.<br /> <br /> Tribe has changed. Are there any Nazis? If yes they are hiding in my opinion, Get is highly political tribe, why? It was written few times in tribebooks. I think that it's much much more complicated tribe then nazi/not nazi thing and I would leave it and concentrate on more cool aspects - mythology, glorious past, heroes of the tribe, maby explained famous/unfamous trials. <br /> Could Fenrir be a villanous tribe? Yes, any tribe could be. It's only a matter of GM and his ideas for chronicle.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1784-werewolf43","name":"werewolf43","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1784_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"315"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-20T00:14:25-07:00","id":1464568,"title":"","content":"I don't know from the american point of view but from my country I don't know a single person who find cool the Get comics ... not because of whatever , but because is extremely goofy and ,well, so stereotipically american.<br /> <br /> Overall, I agree on what I read from you all. I just find cool the idea that some tribes can accuse of fascism some very radical fenris, and to have some packs of fenris (maybe mixed with some camps of other tribes) looking cripto fascist of some kind, it always has been a great addiction from my games and for my gamers perspective. It added crude, dirty realism which I really don't know how to describe properly in english.<br /> <br /> One thing I think they should avoid despite the multicultural aspect of the tribe, is to make the fenris openly progressists. The tragedy of that tribe is build around intolerance and fierce tribal traditionalism, which doesnt have to include pure breeding. <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Changing discussion: what do you think the Wendigo will look like ? Is there any reference to all the tribe becoming multi cultural and conceptual? We should espect them to have spreaded worldwide ? Do you think there is a chance they will be' one of the two tribes that are gone ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\">-'' </span>We are the unsullied.<br /> We are the inheritors.<br /> We are the Pure <span style=\"color:#800000\">''-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","name":"Helur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3773_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-20T02:00:10-07:00","id":1464571,"title":"","content":"As someone from the cold north, I'd like to note that the Fenrir=German angle of 1st edition TB was really painful to read. Aside from that, a lot of Fenrir narrative would work better if people would grasp that each country's tribes are still defined by the country. American is not Scandinavian is not Polish is not Korean,etc.<br /> <br /> Never mind that the whole 'white supremacy' angle would not be limited to one tribe. After all, there are Bone Gnawers, Children of Gaia, Silver Fangs, and Glass Walkers in almost any country. You do not need to be of Fenris' tribe to fall into an intolerant crowd before your change.<br /> <br /> Fenrir just get painted as THE tribe, because the nazi used runes and nordic concepts in their propaganda.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-20T10:57:17-07:00","id":1464597,"title":"","content":"I agree. Concept of multicultural tribes not connected to piece of land and peoples there living is bluring and thinning the core of the tribe, maby even tribe individualism. If everyone could be a Fenrir, everyone could be other tribe member, anyone could be from anytribe so why bother about tribe, is it important only because of gifts and rites it offers? Or ne tribe name exist only to attract old fans while the game wouldn't be about tribes at all?<br /> <br /> As for Wendigo. I think their situation would be same as Get. Exactly the same.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1784-werewolf43","name":"werewolf43","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1784_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"315"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-20T11:26:55-07:00","id":1464602,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>werewolf43</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464597#post1464597\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I agree. Concept of multicultural tribes not connected to piece of land and peoples there living is bluring and thinning the core of the tribe, maby even tribe individualism. If everyone could be a Fenrir, everyone could be other tribe member, anyone could be from anytribe so why bother about tribe, is it important only because of gifts and rites it offers? Or ne tribe name exist only to attract old fans while the game wouldn't be about tribes at all?<br /> <br /> As for Wendigo. I think their situation would be same as Get. Exactly the same.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's why I was asking about the wendigo. I have mixed feelings about the conceptual tribes.<br /> From one side I think it would be' extremely cool to have perdonalzied tribe on local level. On the other side I fear the game could lost something essential for the game identity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\">-'' </span>We are the unsullied.<br /> We are the inheritors.<br /> We are the Pure <span style=\"color:#800000\">''-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","name":"Helur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3773_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-20T11:27:02-07:00","id":1464603,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>werewolf43</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464597#post1464597\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I agree. Concept of multicultural tribes not connected to piece of land and peoples there living is bluring and thinning the core of the tribe, maby even tribe individualism. If everyone could be a Fenrir, everyone could be other tribe member, anyone could be from anytribe so why bother about tribe, is it important only because of gifts and rites it offers? Or ne tribe name exist only to attract old fans while the game wouldn't be about tribes at all?<br /> <br /> As for Wendigo. I think their situation would be same as Get. Exactly the same.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't mean multi-cultural tribes as much as that there can be more than one tribe found in a country. A lot of WtA's early problems with tribes stem from the writers not considering that games can be set OUTSIDE America and there are many tribes found outside tribal lands. So it would not be just FENRIR who'd get invited to bad crowd.<br /> <br /> Nevermind that there was a lot of cognitive dissonance regarding tribes in America. The biggest was that America was not treated as outside the tribal lands, and thus ignoring that most tribes ALREADY do not just reside in their tribal lands.<br /> <br /> W20 has fixed things a lot.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-20T11:43:03-07:00","id":1464607,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464603#post1464603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> . A lot of WtA's early problems with tribes stem from the writers not considering that games can be set OUTSIDE America and there are many tribes found outside tribal lands. </div> </div> </div> </div>There's wisdom behind it. I had problems in 2ed with puting the game in central Europe or in any other place except the America and Egypt (Rage across the Egypt combine with Setites were good enough to create something clever there. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1784-werewolf43","name":"werewolf43","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1784_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"315"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-20T12:54:16-07:00","id":1464623,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464534#post1464534\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Heinrich, I feel like you utterly missed the point of my post.</div> </div> </div> </div>Possibly.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464534#post1464534\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Which is the majority of Get of Fenris aren't German and have been established as being the largest tribe....in Russia. I feel the internationalism of the Get of Fenris has been seriously downplayed. One of the things Heart of the Forest pointed out again was all the Get of Fenris who were Polish.<br /> <br /> How do you think THEY felt about the Nazis?<br /> <br /> THAT is a good solution for the Get=Nazi thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, if the current political situation in Poland is an indicator, they might be somewhat conflicted.<br /> I mean, from what I heat about my neighbour country, nationalism is a topic in Poland: undermining the independence of the courts and just this month the polish supreme court ruled that European law doesn't superimpose over polish national law, despite the polish parliament agreeing to the terms of EU membership.<br /> And we don't have to talk about nationalism in Russia or Belarus.<br /> <br /> But sure, the Polish Get of Fenris would have hated the Nazi Gets, but possibly also the Russian Gets - and also German Gets from before the Nazi rule. There is a lot of history there.<br /> <br /> If the current political climate in Europe, or around the world, for that matter, is any indicator and garou are somewhat similar in their mindset to current human politic, then neo-nazi-ism, right wing extremism and topics like that are things that are still within the tribe. And the Get of Fenris overall mentality and culture is more in-line with such political mindsets as, lets say, the Children of Gaia tribal culture...<br /> Not, that there aren't Children of Gaia neo-nazis, but to me, they are harder to imagine...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464550#post1464550\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fascists have a history of preying on middle of the road liberal democracies and eating them from the inside out, yes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sadly true.<br /> <br /> But my point was that the term Nazi, in a historical context, can describe every person who had joined the party, which a lot of people did out of peer pressure, but also people who were educated to be hateful towards groups the regime wanted to use as scapegoats and eradicate (which included homosexuals, communists, Romani and others), but also those people in power who instrumentalised the situation and instigated the Holocaust.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464550#post1464550\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But why would the Get, who usually have too much Rage to participate in human politics, be involved overly much with that or any other human government? Their kin might have taken positions, but those kin would probably be operating in a capacity similar to monkeywrenchers, because Nazis wanted industrialization, economic control, and urban growth, none of which Garou in general and GoF in particular have historically liked very much.</div> </div> </div> </div>Because of propaganda and ideology. The Nazis also exploited national pride, the sense of belonging to a group, the consequences of loosing WWI, heritage, tradition and a lot of things that are more in line with Get philosophies.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464550#post1464550\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Given the propensity of the tribe to fight against anything even vaguely Aesir, too, they might have decided to get involved against the Nazis as a majority after they traced a bunch of enemy spirits and fomori back to the Nazis, and had their kin hide the folk who the Nazis were hunting on general principle.</div> </div> </div> </div>Also possible.<br /> <br /> It totally depends on the experience people would have made with the Nazi regime and it's consequences, especially before the start of WWII. National work programs, for example, build infrastructure and brought a higher quality of life - and with that purpose and hope. Media lost their independence and the positive aspects of the Nazi rule were dominating the narrative.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464550#post1464550\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This has big time &quot;So much for the tolerant left!&quot; energy.<br /> <br /> This isn't indiscriminate killing. It is, in fact, very discriminate killing - you aren't going around left and right just slaughtering anyone. Swords of Heimdall and other Nazi Garou are very rare, deliberately made a decision to carry on their ideology, and are a blight upon the Gaia they claim to serve by... doing the same things that the Nazis did.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, depending on the way you use the term Nazi - is it association with Nazi-Germany's human politics or is it adherence to nationalistic tendencies in general.<br /> And while the books might tell us, that the Get of Fenris eradicated the more extreme Get of Fenris subgroups, their overall tribal culture is still tied to heritage, supremacy, tradition, elitism and other aspects that are close to Nazi or neo-Nazi ideologies.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464559#post1464559\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly, these sorts of discussions also well... seem to play very loose with the word &quot;fascist,&quot; and edge up on meaning more, &quot;asshole with autocratic leanings,&quot; rather than the specifics that make of fascist ideology (also Nazism is a form of fascism, but not all fascism is Nazism).</div> </div> </div> </div>True, I guess. I'm not a scholar on politics or philosophies, so you might be right there.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464559#post1464559\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For the Get of Fenris might makes right. This means that Get bow to the power of others. The Fenrir might not like it, but if a Bone Gnawer takes on a Fenrir in an honorable duel and wins? The Gnawer was stronger, and is right, and they'll do what the Gnawer says.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I disagree. For me, personally, the Get Tribebook's giveaway was that physical labour and having a bond with what you do is honourable. Being killed by a sniper, or killing someone as a sniper is not. So, if the Fenrir lost to a Glass Walker with his tools, that wouldn't make the Glass Walker right. It would tell the Get of Fenris, that his conviction wasn't strong enough, yet.<br /> <br /> If, might makes right, was the predominant way the Get of Fenris worked, they would be a much smaller tribe and the followers of the urge Wyrm of Power would be more numerous in the BSDs.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464559#post1464559\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For me, the problem with the Swords as a camp, is that it's a really bad way to tackle fascist radicalization in the Fenrir to just have a bunch of Nazi werewolves. The Black Eagle Fellowship is a much better vehicle... as the way fascistic radicialization tends to worm into private paramilitary groups would seem much more timely and believable than openly Nazi werewolves in 2020.</div> </div> </div> </div>True.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Helur</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464568#post1464568\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know from the american point of view but from my country I don't know a single person who find cool the Get comics ... not because of whatever , but because is extremely goofy and ,well, so stereotipically american.</div> </div> </div> </div>Also true, imo.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464571#post1464571\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Never mind that the whole 'white supremacy' angle would not be limited to one tribe. After all, there are Bone Gnawers, Children of Gaia, Silver Fangs, and Glass Walkers in almost any country. You do not need to be of Fenris' tribe to fall into an intolerant crowd before your change.</div> </div> </div> </div>You are not wrong, however, certain tribe wouldn't admit you to a Rite of Passage to join their tribe, if you were, for example, a white supremacist. Or at least, it would be very unlikely. Other tribes, would find such a mentality to be less in contradiction with their tribal culture. Silver Fangs, Shadowlords....<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464571#post1464571\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fenrir just get painted as THE tribe, because the nazi used runes and nordic concepts in their propaganda.</div> </div> </div> </div>Very possibly true.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Helur</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464602#post1464602\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's why I was asking about the wendigo. I have mixed feelings about the conceptual tribes.<br /> From one side I think it would be' extremely cool to have perdonalzied tribe on local level. On the other side I fear the game could lost something essential for the game identity.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, I fear that, too.<br /> Conceptual tribes, first of all, shouldn't be called tribes, since the ancestry angle is one of the criteria that makes a tribe a tribe, as opoosed to another groups.<br /> WtF did conceptual tribes and it would have been fine for WtA, too, if they had been there in 1st Edition. But, back then, Mark had other ideas and that makes part of the identiy of the game and I fear it will get lost.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-20T13:22:38-07:00","id":1464632,"title":"","content":"I'm from Poland and true , todays political scene is a fucking mess. If I could I would remove them all ( politics) from political scene one by one through some garou nasty punishing rite cause the truth is that every one of them would not bear the consequences of their actions.<br /> <br /> Polish Fenrir? My God, in popular fantasy magazine there was Rage across the Poland. And Get was represented by polish football fans, shit that was weird.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1784-werewolf43","name":"werewolf43","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1784_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"315"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-20T13:41:41-07:00","id":1464633,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>heinrich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464623#post1464623\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes, I fear that, too.<br /> Conceptual tribes, first of all, shouldn't be called tribes, since the ancestry angle is one of the criteria that makes a tribe a tribe, as opoosed to another groups.<br /> WtF did conceptual tribes and it would have been fine for WtA, too, if they had been there in 1st Edition. But, back then, Mark had other ideas and that makes part of the identiy of the game and I fear it will get lost.</div> </div> </div> </div>Already in 20th edition in Rage across the World it was said that Wendigo '<i>'<b>almost </b>never accept anglos''</i> and there was also a caern of Wendigo in the middle of Africa. There was some ''subtle'' lines which I was never able to understand properly. Maybe because it's not my native lenguages, maybe because the deveoper wanted to make tribale perspective ''softer''.<br /> I can understand some tribes may need a demographic boom to survive, most likely Wendigo, Red Talons and I don't know, Silent Strider and Star Gazers maybe.<br /> But it also depends on the totem. Maybe everything about it it's up to the totem. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\">-'' </span>We are the unsullied.<br /> We are the inheritors.<br /> We are the Pure <span style=\"color:#800000\">''-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","name":"Helur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3773_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-20T13:55:41-07:00","id":1464638,"title":"","content":"Honestly all this talk about which Tribe has gone rogue and Fascism has reminded me of my single biggest fear of 5E, them reverting the Technocracy back to what it was when MtAs first dropped or worse, turn them into complete jack-booted Techno-Fascists, or even more dreaded, turning them into the Alt-Right but Mages despite how utterly stupid that is. Completely ignoring 20+ years of development and nuance. And potentially declaring that the modern the Technocracy/Order of Reason helped forge is terrible while the past where monsters were in the forests just outside town, arrogant Mages could do what they want and people's life expectancy was half what it was today was actually great.<br /> <br /> And honestly with the way things have been shaping with 5E, that is still a very real fear.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-20T14:08:29-07:00","id":1464640,"title":"","content":"Anglo, in this sense, means white English speaking people in the Americas; anglo being the prefix for English in Latin such as in anglophile. This means that Younger Brother is actually open to European descendants... just generally Hispanic one given the relative ethnic demographics. Someone that's half Navajo and half Chicano wouldn't face significant prejudice in the Tribe despite having strong European ancestry on their ethnically-Mexican side.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-20T15:17:47-07:00","id":1464645,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Helur</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464633#post1464633\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Already in 20th edition in Rage across the World it was said that Wendigo '<i>'<b>almost </b>never accept anglos''</i> and there was also a caern of Wendigo in the middle of Africa. There was some ''subtle'' lines which I was never able to understand properly. Maybe because it's not my native languages, maybe because the devloper wanted to make tribale perspective ''softer''.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know that, and I didn't really like it. For me the Wendigo were filling the niche, the Uktena filling another. Softening the Wendigo made them lose their appeal to me. Also, the story of the Wendigos in Africa, in my opinion was relatively constructed. It would have made more sense to me, if the Wendigo pack there would have turned into a new poroto-Tribe, or if they had found other garou/fera to take over the caern, so they can return to their homeland.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Helur</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464633#post1464633\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can understand some tribes may need a demographic boom to survive, most likely Wendigo, Red Talons and I don't know, Silent Strider and Star Gazers maybe.<br /> But it also depends on the totem. Maybe everything about it it's up to the totem.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, if they were to survive. But, what about not surviving. Dying out of principle might be the way of the garou. The Silent Striders, for example, might not be willing to adopt garou into their tribe, who aren't of their ancestry. Why? Because they are cursed and why would they think it to be honorable and okay to bring that curse down on someone new? Would they rather die out? Quite possibly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-20T16:02:47-07:00","id":1464651,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>heinrich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464623#post1464623\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sadly true.<br /> <br /> But my point was that the term Nazi, in a historical context, can describe every person who had joined the party, which a lot of people did out of peer pressure, but also people who were educated to be hateful towards groups the regime wanted to use as scapegoats and eradicate (which included homosexuals, communists, Romani and others), but also those people in power who instrumentalised the situation and instigated the Holocaust.</div> </div> </div> </div>But Garou don't really have the numbers to do much more than Inglorious Basterds, But With Werewolves. So they would probably have to selectively target in that situation, yes - get anyone who could seem loyal to lure out big shots to isolated locations and fall upon them (the officials already had no honor, so there wouldn't be a point to the Fenrir with treating them any other way but with a brutal and quick slaughter).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Because of propaganda and ideology. The Nazis also exploited national pride, the sense of belonging to a group, the consequences of loosing WWI, heritage, tradition and a lot of things that are more in line with Get philosophies. </div> </div> </div>But they aren't in line with Fenrir philosophy. Fenrir don't want to belong to a group as large as a country. They winnow the ranks of their own through constant battle; their offerings to the spirits prompt them to fight constantly. They wouldn't even have strongly been culturally Germanic or held up Germanic culture, since their progenitor is basically a prime threat in pre-Christian myths and their existence as wolves is a perceived threat to modern humans. And, as noted above by MyWifeIsScary, they wouldn't have cared about the results of Germany losing big in WW1 and getting stuck with all of the burden; WW1 was an industrial slaughter-fest that went against everything that the Fenrir believe in. The more callous among them, perhaps including vindictive lupus in league with Red Talons, would probably be hoping that the humans ran away to other places and left the lands to them.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <br /> Also possible.<br /> <br /> It totally depends on the experience people would have made with the Nazi regime and it's consequences, especially before the start of WWII. National work programs, for example, build infrastructure and brought a higher quality of life - and with that purpose and hope. Media lost their independence and the positive aspects of the Nazi rule were dominating the narrative. </div> </div> </div>As noted, Garou don't tend to look on infrastructure kindly, since it tends to end up either too close to caerns or putting them into an existential crisis. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Well, depending on the way you use the term Nazi - is it association with Nazi-Germany's human politics or is it adherence to nationalistic tendencies in general.<br /> And while the books might tell us, that the Get of Fenris eradicated the more extreme Get of Fenris subgroups, their overall tribal culture is still tied to heritage, supremacy, tradition, elitism and other aspects that are close to Nazi or neo-Nazi ideologies. </div> </div> </div>The only heritage that a Fenrir cares about is descent from Fenris. Their elitism is about being the best player in a game of 'Who's the Best Killer?'. They're explicitly present around the world and in a variety of ethnic groups, because the tribe would have spread widely before coming into its present form.<br /> <br /> Also, if you're going off of &quot;monster wolf eats celestial objects&quot; as a metric for where they've been, that could easily squeeze branches of the Fenrir into India (Rahu) and China (Tiangou, a wolf that chases the sun and moon and has an immortal nemesis that tries to prevent this from happening), with an even wider spread going from there. It's kind of like how the Shadow Lords work with the Hakken and unnamed Mongolian branches of the whole of Thunder's Tribe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-20T16:17:41-07:00","id":1464656,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AkatsukiLeader13</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464638#post1464638\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly all this talk about which Tribe has gone rogue and Fascism has reminded me of my single biggest fear of 5E, them reverting the Technocracy back to what it was when MtAs first dropped or worse, turn them into complete jack-booted Techno-Fascists, or even more dreaded, turning them into the Alt-Right but Mages despite how utterly stupid that is. Completely ignoring 20+ years of development and nuance. And potentially declaring that the modern the Technocracy/Order of Reason helped forge is terrible while the past where monsters were in the forests just outside town, arrogant Mages could do what they want and people's life expectancy was half what it was today was actually great.<br /> <br /> And honestly with the way things have been shaping with 5E, that is still a very real fear.</div> </div> </div> </div>You know what's more worrying? People lack critical reading skills and ways to differentiate fact from misinformation as is. I think Mage is a harder sell than ever as a mainstream game with mainstream exposure in the environment of fake news, rewriting reality by convincing enough people your lies are the truth and that questioning science is the sensible option. I expect things to get even more complicated, and porting Mage as is to new people will be a horrible PR excersise of iffy topics.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-21T02:04:40-07:00","id":1464710,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar23_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"23\" data-vbnamecard=\"23\">Saur Ops Specialist</a> <br /> I think it depends on how separated from their human host societies you believe a tribe is. For, your points are all valid. For my taste, however, I feel that somewhere in the Dark Ages the number of homids started to grow and lupus born stated to decline and with that, the the rise of lost cubs within any tribe, the garou became more than just members of their tribe, as part of their regular identity or sense of self. Which, in itself, might be a problem.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-21T07:26:47-07:00","id":1464736,"title":"","content":"I mean there's a thing about the Technocracy. How is the secret conspiracy that controls the world, government, economics, and military industrial complex a progressive bunch of good guys? I mean, the world is pretty shit because the people who do in the real world are anti-democracy assholes who don't mind the piles of bodies they create as long as they stay in control.<br /> <br /> The Traditions aren't making the World of Darkness shit so who is blocking taxes on the rich and social welfare?<br /> <br /> The reality is more Seers of the Throne for the .01% than the Union of Revised.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/d