les of bodies they create as long as they stay in control.<br /> <br /> The Traditions aren't making the World of Darkness shit so who is blocking taxes on the rich and social welfare?<br /> <br /> The reality is more Seers of the Throne for the .01% than the Union of Revised.</div> </div> </div> </div> In union revised the union conceded they didn't rule the world, they're just the group with the most clout so they don't really 'control' any of those things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-21T09:04:02-07:00","id":1464747,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1463829-new-w5-info-from-the-14th-of-october-twitch?p=1464746#post1464746\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In union revised the union conceded they didn't rule the world, they're just the group with the most clout so they don't really 'control' any of those things.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, why bother using the Union at all if you're going to change them so much?<br /> <br /> The whole point of the union is they're the Men in Black, shadowy conspiracy that suppresses the cure for cancer if it's not on the time table.<br />","